			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_COMMON",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Neko",
					"Paimon"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 722090101,
					"content": "Another quiet day today...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090102,
					"content": "Ah, arrived, have you? I slept most well last night after you cleaned the shrine... meow, meow...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090103,
					"content": "Those two people in green came by for a stroll yesterday as well.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090104,
					"content": "That said, no other humans besides them came to pay their respects here. Very strange...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090105,
					"content": "But when those two green humans came by, they seemed quite interested in that wooden rack there, meow.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090106,
					"content": "I recall Hibiki calling the rack itself a \"Prayer Rack,\" and these small wooden blocks \"Prayer Plaques.\" It just so happened that many people frequented this shrine on the account of this wooden rack.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090107,
					"content": "Hmm... Does this mean that humans love wood? It is true that many visitors would go to that wooden rack to hang small wooden blocks after offering up some Mora.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090108,
					"content": "I—I don't think it's because they love the wood...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722090109,
					"content": "Is that so? Then... did they do it because they dislike wood? ...To punish the wood, perhaps?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090110,
						722090111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090110,
					"content": "The wood is really not the important part...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722090112,
					"content": "...Whatever the case may be, the rack is now in a sorry state and has been left wanting for more wooden blocks.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090113,
					"content": "Though I cannot claim to understand the relationship between humans and wood, a shrine must have these all the same.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090114,
					"content": "It must be the ruination of the rack and the shrine running out of wood that no one comes by anymore.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090115,
					"content": "As such, I must ask another thing of you — to fix that wooden rack.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090116,
						722090121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090116,
					"content": "Well, leave that to us.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722090117,
					"content": "Now that you mention it, we should have some leftover material from when we fixed that Offering Box, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090118,
					"content": "Of such things, I cannot be sure... Why do you humans love wood so much, anyway?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090119,
					"content": "Uh, you know what, never mind... Paimon remembers that we have some spares. Let's look around a bit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090120,
					"content": "Whatever the case may be, I shall leave the matter of the wooden shelf to you. This shrine will not take care of itself, after all, meow.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090129,
					"content": "Once that box and shelf are both fixed, the number of humans coming here should swell.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090121,
					"content": "How long has this thing been in disrepair?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 722090122,
					"content": "Very long. It fell apart before the box did, and the box fell into ruin ages ago.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090123,
					"content": "So you don't know at all, do you...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090124,
					"content": "Hah. I do not particularly follow how many times the sun rises or sets.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090125,
					"content": "Well, we should have some stuff left over from when we were fixing that Offering Box, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090126,
					"content": "Of such things, I cannot be sure... Why do you humans love wood so much, anyway?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090127,
					"content": "Uh, you know what, never mind... Paimon remembers that we have some spares. Let's look around a bit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090128,
					"content": "Whatever the case may be, I shall leave the matter of the wooden shelf to you. This shrine will not take care of itself, after all, meow.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Neko"
				},
				{
					"id": 722090111,
					"content": "It has nothing to do with the material, per se...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722090112
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7220902,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
